Need fast random access? → vector
Need fast front + back insert/delete? → deque
Need LIFO (last in, first out)? → stack
Need FIFO (first in, first out)? → queue
Need smallest/largest quickly? → priority_queue
Need sorted unique elements? → set
Need sorted key-value pairs? → map
Need fast exists check (unordered)? → unordered_set
Need fast key-value lookup (unordered)? → unordered_map
Need duplicates + sorted? → multiset
Need range queries on sorted data? → set or map (lower/upper bound)
